 "verdict": "distance alone supplies 82% of the headline AUPRC (0.5152 of 0.6274), so most of the discrimination is GEOMETRY. power alone is not a predictor (AUPRC 0.2302 vs base 0.1939). the biology survives the strictest split at AUPRC 0.6274. within-gene cluster permutation z +5.22 (survives). after matching on power, |effect| and distance the lift falls to 1.32x (AUPRC 0.6622, AUROC 0.6497, permutation p 0.0323), and DISTANCE-ONLY collapses to chance on that matched set (AUROC 0.4722). within K562 alone under gene-held-out folds it holds at 3.37x (AUROC 0.8597), so cell type is not the explanation."
